(b) whethe Government is considering holding elections to the cantonment boards, or merging them with the municipal bodies of the civilian areas is being considered; 
(c) whether Government will continue to release the amount of grant being given to these cantonment boards until a decision is taken on this matter; and
(d) if not, the reasons therefor?

