(b) whether any scheme is being formulated by Government to save these banks from closure; and
(c) if so, the details thereof?

(a) the total number of hydroelectric projects being operated in the State of Uttarakhand by the Central Government companies NTPC and NHPC;
(b) the quantum of total electricity being supplied to the State of Uttarakhand from these hydroelectric projects; 
(c) whether proposals for new projects by these companies are also under consideration of Government; and
(d) if so, the details thereof?

