(b) whether the benefits of the scheme are being provided on priority basis to the economically weaker sections;
(c) whether Government is considering increasing the subsidy under the scheme, if so, the proposed structure of the subsidy;
(d) the steps taken to ensure the quality and longevity of the solar panels under the scheme; and
(e) the digital platform adopted to monitor the impact of the scheme?

